{"id":"9135c45b14ec366c","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-j-sheaf-object.md","title":"Definition — j-层对象","display":"Definition — j-层对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","aliases":["14-df-j-sheaf-object"],"display":"Definition — j-层对象","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-j-sheaf-object"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-j-sheaf-object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — j-层对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a> 的 LT 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，j-稠密见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsMono}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\Rightarrow\\forall f:A\\to X\\ \\exists!g:B\\to X\\ (g\\circ m=f)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsMono}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\Rightarrow\\forall f:A\\to X\\ \\exists!g:B\\to X\\ (g\\circ m=f)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.2。定义使用全体稠密单射的唯一延拓性质；所有载体和同态集合都绑定于 E。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j$ 是 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]] 的 LT 拓扑；$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，j-稠密见 [[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j$ 是 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]] 的 LT 拓扑；$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，j-稠密见 [[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsMono}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\Rightarrow\\forall f:A\\to X\\ \\exists!g:B\\to X\\ (g\\circ m=f)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1103,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object|Definition — j-层对象]]"},{"id":"a48988fed4470569","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 为 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]] 的满子范畴；$j$ 为 LT 拓扑；$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}$ 见 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]；$e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega$ 取 $j$ 与 $1_\\Omega$ 的等化子。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]"},{"id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 $\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)$。$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 见 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]；满子范畴见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object|Definition — j-层对象]]"},{"id":"7b364b0997153626","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]] 的精确签名。"},{"id":"ddd71b28b9e13b9b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}$、$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{IsNatural}$、$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}$、$\\mathrm{IsLeftExact}$ 依次使用[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-functor]]、[[14-df-natural-transformation]]、[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]的已列定义；其结构参数由上述 $\\mathcal E,\\mathcal H,i,a_j,\\eta$ 固定。$\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal H}(a_j(A))$ 采用 [[14-df-subobjects]] 的单态射同构类集合。"},{"id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"24d8686d42636bb7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,X$ 满足 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]] 的结构声明；分离性见 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]。"},{"id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)$ 采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","ce0c3e433ca617db","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f"]}